{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/55546747107b3c3bb846c8689d50d7c5.poster.avif?t=1762448527\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/55546747107b3c3bb846c8689d50d7c5.webm?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/55546747107b3c3bb846c8689d50d7c5.mp4?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Red Machina</i></strong><i> is a virtual system created to fulfill the darkest desires of its players. X, the last player to access it, finds himself trapped in a plot of corruption, betrayal, and collapse.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disturbing Secrets Await You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/63b832b8881f4d00bcf9e50f8cdeb9e8.poster.avif?t=1762448527\" width=1078 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/63b832b8881f4d00bcf9e50f8cdeb9e8.webm?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/63b832b8881f4d00bcf9e50f8cdeb9e8.mp4?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore different maps, you will encounter unique stories and gameplay. Each character plays a key role in accomplishing your mission;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs feature multiple dialogue choices, allowing players to shape X\u2019s personality as they wish\u2014 aggressive, passive, emotional, or chaotic;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/3cf50c01c85601aa3702caf13fa0b4a9.poster.avif?t=1762448527\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/3cf50c01c85601aa3702caf13fa0b4a9.webm?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/3cf50c01c85601aa3702caf13fa0b4a9.mp4?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resident Evil 1, Silent Hill, and Cosmology of Kyoto are the main inspirations for Red Machina\u2019s graphics and visuals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio faithful to PSX limitations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertex lighting;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures inspired by the restrictions of the original PlayStation era;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/c0e7a2f86217974eced40b2ed9c770dd.poster.avif?t=1762448527\" width=1078 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/c0e7a2f86217974eced40b2ed9c770dd.webm?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles and Dilemmas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/7360deec0dd4d524a5117aab95b0001c.poster.avif?t=1762448527\" width=1078 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/7360deec0dd4d524a5117aab95b0001c.webm?t=1762448527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and dialogues define the type of player you are, as well as the consequences this will bring to X\u2019s story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Average playtime: 2  hours.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1379880?t=1762448527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/fcfba5f965c6f1655484250016a289e540113922/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762448527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/52f3d76fe82f30811a49cc839bf4f52b9baa9a2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762448527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/52f3d76fe82f30811a49cc839bf4f52b9baa9a2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762448527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"RED MACHINA contains scenes of violence, alcohol abuse, and nudity."},"demos":[{"appid":4003580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379880/extras/55546747107b3c3bb846c8689d50d7c5.poster.avif?t=1762448527\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st